# Agile Iteration Master Plan (AIMP): Unified Developmental Backbone (UDB)

**Author:** Senior Product & Project Manager
**Project Duration:** 10 Months (40 Weeks)
**Iteration Cycle:** Bi-weekly Sprints (2 Weeks each)
**Platform:** Google Antigravity / Google Cloud

---

## 1. Roadmap Overview: The 4-Pillar Iteration Strategy
The development is structured into 20 sprints, grouped into 4 major Release Cycles. Each release delivers a functional, testable version of the platform.

| Release | Focus | Sprints | Key Outcome |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **R1: Foundation** | Core Infrastructure & Habits | S1 - S5 | Functional Parent/Child App with Gamified Quests. |
| **R2: Intelligence** | Academic & AI Mentoring | S6 - S10 | LMS Integration & Socratic AI Tutor active. |
| **R3: Ecosystem** | Social & Blockchain | S11 - S15 | Joon World & Achievement NFT minting. |
| **R4: Governance** | Entrepreneurship & Monitoring | S16 - S20 | Kid-Preneur Hub & Cross-Platform Agents. |

---

## 2. Detailed Iteration Breakdown (Release 1: Foundation)

### Iteration 1 (S1): The Backbone Initialization (Weeks 1-2)
*   **Use Cases:** UC-001 (Reg), UC-004 (Profile), UC-005 (Linking), UC-006 (Audit).
*   **Tasks:**
    *   Setup pnpm monorepo & Cloud SQL (Architect Agent).
    *   Implement Auth0 Family Flow (Backend Agent).
    *   Initialize WORM Audit Logging (QA Agent).
*   **Deliverable:** Family account creation & secure login functional.

### Iteration 2 (S2): The Habit Engine (Weeks 3-4)
*   **Use Cases:** UC-013 (Library), UC-014 (Custom Activity), UC-018 (Mark Complete).
*   **Tasks:**
    *   Build Activity Schema & S3 Media Upload (Backend Agent).
    *   Develop "Doter" State Machine v1 (Architect Agent).
    *   Create Activity Evidence Upload flow (UC-019).
*   **Deliverable:** Parents can assign tasks; Kids can submit photo evidence.

### Iteration 3 (S3): Intelligent Scheduling (Weeks 5-6)
*   **Use Cases:** UC-015 (Schedule), UC-022 (Conflict Resolution), UC-044 (Weekly Planner).
*   **Tasks:**
    *   Implement RRULE-based calendar engine (Backend Agent).
    *   Build the AI Conflict Resolution modal (AI Scientist).
    *   Develop the first iteration of the Weekly Planning Assistant.
*   **Deliverable:** Zero-conflict family schedule with AI planning suggestions.

