## 4. Risk & Dependency Management

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation Strategy |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **LMS API Changes** | High | Use abstraction layers for Google/Canvas integrations. |
| **AI Hallucinations** | Medium | Implement strict "Grounding" in RAG pipelines using the UUCS. |
| **COPPA Compliance** | Critical | Bi-weekly security audits by the Antigravity QA Agent. |

---

## 5. Feedback & Evaluation Loop
At the end of **every sprint**:
1.  **Demo:** Antigravity Architect provides a live URL of the new features.
2.  **Audit:** QA Agent runs the "Requirement Traceability Matrix."
3.  **Review:** You provide feedback using the **Antigravity Operational Manual** commands.
4.  **Refine:** Next sprint's backlog is adjusted based on your "Course Correction" prompts.
